From 6151b55816571b244b4846a40d075f3a5acd75ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI Lab <83042094+MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:13:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] inkling2: native e2m1x2/e4m3x2 decode expert unpacking
 (TF_INKLING2_EXPERT_NATIVE_UNPACK)

Opt nvfp4_experts into -Dnative-fp-decode and add native decode expert
entries for NVFP4 (e2m1x2 + e4m3x2 scales) and MXFP8 (e4m3x2) behind
TF_INKLING2_EXPERT_NATIVE_UNPACK (default on).

Exactness: 6/6 ex.sh cells pass (30/30 rows identical to s3_base),
48/48 A-B-B-A token SHAs identical.
dec8 A-B-B-A: plain1 +0.23%, greedy1 +0.29%, bench1 +0.54%, bench2 +0.28%,
bench4 +0.33%, bench8 +0.15%, live8 +0.65%.
---
