 zig/kernels/cuda/fp8_experts.cu   |  18 ++++-
 zig/kernels/cuda/nvfp4_experts.cu | 120 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 zig/src/cuda/experts.zig          |   8 +-
 zig/src/cuda/experts_mx.zig       |  22 +++++-
 5 files changed, 154 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

